    "body": "local commit 47d8342 on issue/22-eikonal-band (not pushed yet): `FieldLattice::renormalize` (crates/sim/src/stock_sim/preview/eikonal.rs), one fast-sweeping cycle over the band with the zero-set texels frozen, called from `PackedBase::of` before the GPU upload. Pinned by crates/sim/tests/stock_eikonal.rs (6 tests): CSG band mean | |grad| - 1 | 0.367 -> 0.048; signs and zero-crossing texels bit-identical; cylinder pocket within 0.21 of exact at cell 0.5. Sim suites green except overhang_laws (3 failures, also red on origin/main without this change).\n",
